1
00:00:00,142 --> 00:00:02,982
(Bernadette:)You're so brave. I'm proud of you.

2
00:00:03,521 --> 00:00:05,941
(Howard:)I ate a butterfly.

3
00:00:13,405 --> 00:00:15,785
(Howard:)It was so small...

4
00:00:17,159 --> 00:00:19,039
(Howard:)...beautiful...

5
00:00:20,037 --> 00:00:22,577
(Howard:)...but I was so hungry.

6
00:00:25,417 --> 00:00:29,417
- Are you crying?
- No, I don't think it's possible.

7
00:00:29,630 --> 00:00:32,720
(Howard:)I'm severely dehydrated.

8
00:00:33,759 --> 00:00:36,469
(Howard:)My pee is like toothpaste.

9
00:00:38,013 --> 00:00:40,643
(Bernadette:)Howie, if you're not able to do this,
come home.

10
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:43,600
(Bernadette:)It won't change how I feel about you.

11
00:00:43,811 --> 00:00:47,191
(Howard:)Thanks, honey, but I can't quit.

12
00:00:47,398 --> 00:00:49,648
If I do, l'd just be a guy...

13
00:00:49,859 --> 00:00:53,779
(Howard:)...who had a chance to be an astronaut
and gave it up.

14
00:00:53,988 --> 00:00:55,988
ls there anything I could do to help?

15
00:00:56,532 --> 00:00:58,072
(Sheldon:)No.

